      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>What does the text, &quot;the first time...&quot; mean? I didn&#39;t really understand it before the expansion but with the Ennead based around that text I thought I should learn. Does that mean the effect of the text only gets played once and then is done because that was the first time?</p>",
