      "created_at": "2012-09-29T21:58:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That text happens the first time each turn the relevant event occurs.&nbsp; It would happen every turn if it were triggered every turn, but only the first time.</p><p>Does that answer your question?</p>",
